{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19941","headline":"石淙 五 · 孟郊","name":"石淙 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空谷耸视听，幽湍泽心灵。\n疾流脱鳞甲，叠岸冲风霆。\n丹巘堕环景，霁波灼虚形。\n淙淙豗厚轴，棱棱攒高冥。\n弱栈跨旋碧，危梯倚凝青。\n飘飘鹤骨仙，飞动鳌背庭。\n常闻夸大言，下顾皆细萍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19941.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19941","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}